  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/WtH7A8O.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/differentiate\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Requires Differentiate&color=7C1C4E&labelColor=FF8EB0&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge\" alt=\"Differentiate\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/fwnAcVxFss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/793584935268909116?label=&logo=discord&color=7C1C4E&labelColor=FF8EB0&logoColor=white&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Eltrut &amp; Co. Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Eltrut-Co/Lepton\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Source Code&color=7C1C4E&labelColor=FF8EB0&style=for-the-badge&logo=github\" alt=\"Lepton on Github\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcreativecommons.org%252flicenses%252fby-nc-sa%252f4.0%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=License&message=CC BY-NC-SA 4.0&color=7C1C4E&labelColor=FF8EB0&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Lepton 是一款旨在为游戏添加本应默认存在的方块的模组，例如原版楼梯、台阶、围墙、压力板和按钮等！目前主要专注于移植一些在 1.12 版本中被遗忘的 Quark 特性，同时也加入了一些新功能，例如裂纹砂岩。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>致谢：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Rexschwert，负责俄语翻译</span></p>",
